          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Essential checklist for students and parents before confirming an engineering seat. Identifies common admission mistakes, risks of paying full fee upfront, understanding statutory refund rules, fee breakdown transparency, certificate verification, and avoiding pressure tactics.</rdf:li>
